{"timestamp": 1779431624.394662, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 14, "data": {"caller": "player_5", "reason": "Frank reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "security", "victim_name": "Charlie"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779431624.3957026, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 14, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779431637.3602471, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I just found Charlie's body in Security. My path this round was Medbay to Upper Engine, back through Medbay to Electrical, and then finally into Security where I stumbled on the body. \n\nThe only person I ran into recently was Bob in Electrical. Bob, you came down from the Cafeteria shortly before I headed into Security. Did you happen to see anyone else over there, or anyone heading toward Weapons or Security? Let's hear where everyone else was, especially if you were on the right side of the ship."}}
{"timestamp": 1779431645.4045029, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I started the round in Security, and I can confirm it was completely clear when I was there. From Security, I went to Electrical, then Medbay, and I was just working on my task in Storage when the meeting was called. I didn't see Charlie or anyone else on my way through the left side of the map, until Diana walked into Storage from Navigation right before the bell rang. \n\nSince Security was empty when I left, Charlie must have been killed after I passed through. Frank, if you came from Electrical to Security and found the body, the killer probably either vented or slipped away towards Weapons or Navigation. Let's see what Bob says about Electrical, and if anyone was near Weapons."}}
{"timestamp": 1779431675.6569355, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I started lower engine, went through Storage to Navigation, then cut back through Security/Electrical toward Medbay. I did pass Security earlier and Charlie was alive there when I went through \u2014 I didn\u2019t see a body at that point. After that I went into Electrical and saw Frank come in from Medbay, then I continued to Medbay where I was when the report happened.\n\nSo the kill timing feels like it had to be after I left Security and before Frank got there. That makes me want to hear from Bob and Diana especially \u2014 Bob because Frank saw him in Electrical coming from Cafeteria side, and Diana because Eve says she came from Navigation into Storage right before the report. Did either of you pass Security or Weapons?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779431691.6721494, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I can confirm Eve's story\u2014I ended up in Storage with her right before the meeting was called. My path this round was Electrical, to Security, then down to Navigation, and finally over to Storage. \n\nWhen I was passing through Security early on (around tick 5 or 6), I can confirm Charlie was there and still alive. \n\nAlice, your timeline is a bit suspicious to me. I didn't cross paths with you in Navigation or Security. More importantly, you claim you saw Frank in Electrical, but Frank specifically said the *only* person he ran into recently was Bob. Frank didn't mention seeing you at all. \n\nBob, you're up next. Did you see Alice in Electrical or anywhere on the right side of the ship? Right now, Alice is my main suspect because her story doesn't seem to line up with what Frank and I experienced. I won't vote just yet, but I want everyone to pay close attention to Bob's statement."}}
{"timestamp": 1779431706.3948758, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I can clear this up right now. Diana is spot on to be suspicious of Alice, because Alice's story is completely falling apart. \n\nMy path this round was Upper Engine to Oxygen, across to Cafeteria, and then down into Electrical. I can absolutely confirm Frank's story \u2014 I ran into Frank in Electrical around tick 12 right before he headed toward Security. \n\nHere is the nail in the coffin: I did *not* see Alice in Electrical at all. If she had passed through Security to Electrical and saw Frank there, I would have seen her too. So let's review: Diana didn't see Alice in Navigation or Security, Frank didn't see Alice in Electrical, and I didn't see Alice in Electrical. \n\nAlice is entirely fabricating her path. She likely killed Charlie in Security, slipped away, and is now trying to insert herself into our timeline to look innocent. \n\nSince I'm the last to speak and we have multiple people contradicting Alice's claims, I am very confident she is our Duck. I'm voting Alice, and I strongly suggest you all do the same."}}
{"timestamp": 1779431728.6267965, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 14, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "Bob and Diana are spot on, and I can confirm their deductions 100%. Alice, you claim you saw me in Electrical, but that is impossible. I was in Electrical around tick 12, and the *only* person I saw was Bob coming from the Cafeteria. If you were in Electrical or passing through from Security, I would have seen you. \n\nSince your path contradicts what Diana, Bob, and I all saw, you're clearly fabricating your route to cover up killing Charlie in Security. You've been caught in a lie by three different people. I'm confident Alice is the Duck, and I'll be voting for her."}}
